# Test-only sources, npm/JS/TS/builders/config/artifacts/workflows are normal agent review.
# Embedded test-only hunks are outside policy scope; path-only enforcement cannot distinguish them.
# Signing/settings/irreversible/double-mint authority remains in CANONICAL_CONTRACT.md.

